{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:39 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:39 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:39 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"尖沙咀保時捷違例遇截查 車內搜出懷疑大麻 男司機涉藥駕被捕。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6d2eb1b922ffecde84f4bf2adcd822c1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_59_2_.jpeg\"/><p>尖沙咀發生懷疑藥駕案。今日（18日）晚上10時02分，西九龍交通部人員在碧仙桃道截停一輛保時捷SUV，並在車內搜出少量大麻，男司機涉嫌藥後駕駛被捕。</p><p>據了解，涉事保時捷SUV沿加拿芬道左轉入碧仙桃道時，西九龍交通部人員發現車輛形迹可疑，並涉及違例事項，遂上前截查。人員其後在車內發現少量大麻，緝毒犬奉召到場協助搜索。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"保時捷男司機當場被捕。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9cec6b91e16f4c764cd46fc2255f7cb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"保時捷男司機當場被捕。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0eb7c1d00b2cff82a829be24c16e431e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"西九龍交通部人員在碧仙桃道截查一輛可疑私家車，車上搜出懷疑大麻。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e2e919f8303bde8c158e151b318afe8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"緝毒太奉召到場協助搜車。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fbaca9cfb99b03d39f05cec7e635f38/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_58.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"緝毒太奉召到場協助搜車。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03948bbb3c12eb61dea3adac6bd9adc2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_07_59.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T15:58:42.232057+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:39:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:57:34.113435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T15:57:37.260511+00:00","content_hash":"b1ad7e52c5dd13cebc3c070b9b2d42cebe655c24d587a181a186448325e2412c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}